<title>USA: U.S. 1996 soybeans in major states - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. 1996 soybeans in major states - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA 1996 soybean estimates in major states, and revised 1995 estimates.</p>
<p>    PRODUCTION, 1,000 bushels:    YIELD, bushels/acre:</p>
<p> -	  1996--Prev.96    1995    1996-Prev.96  1995</p>
<p> Ill   384,150  364,450  378,300   39.0   37.0   39.0</p>
<p> Ind   203,680  187,600  196,710   38.0   35.0   39.5</p>
<p> Iowa  415,800  415,800  407,440   44.0   44.0   44.0</p>
<p> Minn  218,300  212,400  234,900   37.0   36.0   40.5</p>
<p> Mo    145,800  141,750  132,750   36.0   35.0   29.5</p>
<p> Neb   135,450  132,440  100,980   45.0   44.0   33.0</p>
<p> Ohio  152,660  143,680  153,140   34.0   32.0   38.0</p>
<p>HARVEST ACRES, in 1,000s:</p>
<p>   -	1996--Prev.96   1995</p>
<p> Ill     9,850   9,850   9,700</p>
<p> Ind     5,360   5,360   4,980</p>
<p> Iowa    9,450   9,450   9,260</p>
<p> Minn    5,900   5,900   5,800</p>
<p> Mo	4,050   4,050   4,500</p>
<p> Neb     3,010   3,010   3,060</p>
<p> Ohio    4,490   4,490   4,030</p>
